# T77 smart downloads (row I169): the history holds play2 (twice, written by the engine in smart_history.sel, I170a), the saved view "smart" holds song.mod, and play1
# is queued and played. The smart plan fetches the view first, then the most played history, behind the foreground
# fetch. @prefetch_wait waits until the library thread is idle; counters are printed at the end.
VIEW_SAVE smart gammathree
QUEUE_ADD modland:Protracker/test/play1.mod
PLAY
@render 1024
@prefetch_wait
@render 1024
